{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 13424787357272457880,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Priviledged instruction set",
      "source_hash": 15123257209574995656,
      "context_hash": 13394022504806036115,
      "translation": "특권 명령어 세트",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:06.891866Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Now I'd like to extend FemtoRV32 to make it Linux-capable, step by step.",
      "source_hash": 8053436367427577404,
      "context_hash": 9803634299909221258,
      "translation": "이제 FemtoRV32를 확장하여 리눅스를 실행할 수 있도록 단계별로 만들어 보고자 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:06.891867Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Here is the plan:",
      "source_hash": 16010490415483417391,
      "context_hash": 13328280382702733093,
      "translation": "계획은 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:06.891867Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The first step is to implement exceptions, interrupts, the `ECALL` instruction, and catch system calls in an exception handler.",
      "source_hash": 15596791716996693364,
      "context_hash": 10594772778424973041,
      "translation": "첫 번째 단계는 예외, 인터럽트, `ECALL` 명령어를 구현하고, 예외 핸들러에서 시스템 콜을 잡아내는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:06.891867Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "This is still with a single privilege level (machine mode).",
      "source_hash": 3593760426460716327,
      "context_hash": 15938732230240753030,
      "translation": "이는 여전히 단일 권한 수준(머신 모드)에서 이루어집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:06.891867Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "At the end of the first step, it will be possible to run ELF executables compiled with gcc and its standard library.",
      "source_hash": 1914182053818907928,
      "context_hash": 13984754220767066523,
      "translation": "첫 번째 단계가 끝나면 gcc와 그 표준 라이브러리로 컴파일된 ELF 실행 파일을 실행할 수 있게 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:06.891867Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The second step is to implement two privilege levels, and protect the memory used in machine mode.",
      "source_hash": 9064533544581427016,
      "context_hash": 7893223894422608463,
      "translation": "두 번째 단계는 두 개의 권한 수준을 구현하고, 머신 모드에서 사용되는 메모리를 보호하는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:06.891867Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "The third step is to implement the MMU and virtual adressing.",
      "source_hash": 14998846711867641046,
      "context_hash": 13347320855086007418,
      "translation": "세 번째 단계는 MMU와 가상 주소 지정을 구현하는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:06.891867Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Let's see how to implement the privileged instruction set.",
      "source_hash": 3338326752396955429,
      "context_hash": 18170704129300256617,
      "translation": "특권 명령어 세트를 어떻게 구현하는지 살펴봅시다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:06.891868Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "Unfortunately, the [Volume II of the RISC-V manual](https://github.com/riscv/riscv-isa-manual/releases/download/Ratified-IMFDQC-and-Priv-v1.11/riscv-privileged-20190608.pdf) (privileged instruction set) is - I think - not written as well as volume I.",
      "source_hash": 17086396704416559870,
      "context_hash": 10534720032222509142,
      "translation": "안타깝게도 [RISC-V 매뉴얼 2권](https://github.com/riscv/riscv-isa-manual/releases/download/Ratified-IMFDQC-and-Priv-v1.11/riscv-privileged-20190608.pdf)(특권 명령어 세트)은 제 생각에는 1권만큼 잘 쓰여 있지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RISC-V": "RISC-V"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:06.891868Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:2",
      "source": "With volume I on my knees, I could write the Verilog for RV32I in a couple of days.",
      "source_hash": 6493202000599908913,
      "context_hash": 13394285602309394480,
      "translation": "1권을 무릎에 올려놓고서는 며칠 만에 RV32I용 Verilog를 작성할 수 있었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Verilog": "Verilog"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:06.891868Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:3",
      "source": "With Volume II, it is another story, because Volume II lists all the CSR registers, without giving a structured view of what does what, and of what's important and what's optional.",
      "source_hash": 6220389756932946601,
      "context_hash": 17151283418330095184,
      "translation": "2권은 이야기가 다른데, 2권은 모든 CSR 레지스터를 나열하고 있지만 무엇이 무슨 역할을 하는지, 무엇이 중요하고 무엇이 선택적인지에 대한 구조화된 시각은 제공하지 않기 때문입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:06.891868Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "There is another source of information that we can use: @ultraembedded developed a software emulator for different processors, including RV32 (and RV64), it is [here](https://github.com/ultraembedded/exactstep).",
      "source_hash": 9020481630202643726,
      "context_hash": 10191839482000166969,
      "translation": "우리가 활용할 수 있는 또 다른 정보원이 있습니다: @ultraembedded가 RV32(및 RV64)를 포함한 다양한 프로세서용 소프트웨어 에뮬레이터를 개발했으며, [여기](https://github.com/ultraembedded/exactstep)에서 볼 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:06.891868Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:6/seg:1",
      "source": "Interestingly, it is driven cycle by cycle, so it is a good starting point for having a more _systemic_ view of the privileged instruction set.",
      "source_hash": 12968127212041575393,
      "context_hash": 7186880125739066467,
      "translation": "흥미롭게도 이는 사이클 단위로 동작하므로, 특권 명령어 세트에 대해 좀 더 *체계적인* 시각을 갖기 위한 좋은 출발점이 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:06.891868Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:6/seg:2",
      "source": "So I'll continue, with _RISC-V Volume II_ on my knees and two open tabs with [rv32.h](https://github.com/ultraembedded/exactstep/blob/master/cpu-rv32/rv32.h) and [rv32.cpp](https://github.com/ultraembedded/exactstep/blob/master/cpu-rv32/rv32.cpp).",
      "source_hash": 6830857570684539103,
      "context_hash": 16173644729441493296,
      "translation": "그래서 *RISC-V 2권*을 무릎에 올려놓고, [rv32.h](https://github.com/ultraembedded/exactstep/blob/master/cpu-rv32/rv32.h)와 [rv32.cpp](https://github.com/ultraembedded/exactstep/blob/master/cpu-rv32/rv32.cpp) 두 탭을 열어둔 채로 계속 진행하겠습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:06.891868Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "The first thing I'll do is noting in `rv32.h` which CSR are used, and looking them up in _RISC-V Volume II_.",
      "source_hash": 3124293122612043533,
      "context_hash": 10968026187469252321,
      "translation": "제가 가장 먼저 할 일은 `rv32.h`에서 어떤 CSR이 사용되는지 표시하고, *RISC-V 2권*에서 그것들을 찾아보는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:06.891868Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:7/seg:1",
