    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:65/seg:0",
      "source": "mtvec",
      "source_hash": 14907270912481387641,
      "context_hash": 7956473839462920761,
      "translation": "mtvec",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:04.311234Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:66/seg:0",
      "source": "machine trap handler base address (also called mevec)",
      "source_hash": 13238201634538315162,
      "context_hash": 5744087981190481509,
      "translation": "머신 트랩 핸들러 기준 주소(mevec이라고도 불립니다)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:04.311235Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:67/seg:0",
      "source": "mtval",
      "source_hash": 5433274684646211511,
      "context_hash": 15451450830852953815,
      "translation": "mtval",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:04.311236Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:68/seg:0",
      "source": "machine bad address or instruction",
      "source_hash": 7417880079436107452,
      "context_hash": 14934097754673938003,
      "translation": "잘못된 머신 주소 또는 명령어",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:04.311236Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:69/seg:0",
      "source": "(in addition there is a `mscratch` scratch register that can be used by the exception handlers).",
      "source_hash": 1397400723256838401,
      "context_hash": 10878409279518007819,
      "translation": "(추가로 예외 핸들러가 사용할 수 있는 `mscratch` 스크래치 레지스터도 있습니다.)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:04.311237Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:70/seg:0",
      "source": "Let us take a look now at the code that handles exceptions, line 755.",
      "source_hash": 2523646565176975570,
      "context_hash": 8402644375762579214,
      "translation": "이제 예외를 처리하는 코드, 755번째 줄을 살펴봅시다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:04.311238Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:70/seg:1",
      "source": "Since we only have machine mode, we directly jump to line 800:",
      "source_hash": 13943156873174226639,
      "context_hash": 8528082527510184104,
      "translation": "머신 모드만 있으므로 곧바로 800번째 줄로 넘어갑니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:04.311238Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:72/seg:0",
      "source": "In a nutshell, calling the exception means _doing something with the machine status register_ (we'll see later), then setting `mepc` (to the current or the next instruction ? we'll see later), `mcause` and `mtval`, then jumping to `mevec` (and also changing privilege level, but at step 1 we do not do that).",
      "source_hash": 8267812243863234799,
      "context_hash": 9769090958149405366,
      "translation": "요약하면, 예외를 호출한다는 것은 *머신 상태 레지스터로 무언가를 처리하는 것*(나중에 살펴보겠습니다)을 의미하며, 그 다음 `mepc`(현재 명령어인지 다음 명령어인지는 나중에 살펴보겠습니다)와 `mcause`, `mtval`을 설정하고, `mevec`으로 점프합니다(권한 수준도 변경되지만, 1단계에서는 이를 수행하지 않습니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:04.311239Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:73/seg:0",
      "source": "and we take a look at the way `MRET` is handled, line 1363:",
      "source_hash": 17633762743945362949,
      "context_hash": 7773547817956034994,
      "translation": "그리고 `MRET`이 어떻게 처리되는지, 1363번째 줄을 살펴봅니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:04.311239Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:75/seg:0",
      "source": "OK, more or less what I expected, that is _undoing the stuff with the machine status register_, and jumping to the previously stored address in `mepc` (and also changing privilege level but we do not need to do that in step 1).",
      "source_hash": 6445820539936737546,
      "context_hash": 5611797772231179175,
      "translation": "좋습니다, 예상했던 것과 거의 같습니다. 즉 *머신 상태 레지스터에 대한 작업을 되돌리고*, `mepc`에 이전에 저장된 주소로 점프합니다(권한 수준도 변경되지만, 1단계에서는 이를 수행할 필요가 없습니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:04.311240Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:76/seg:0",
      "source": "Two questions remain to be answered:",
      "source_hash": 2588953595369959088,
      "context_hash": 6561799581861559119,
      "translation": "아직 답해야 할 질문이 두 가지 남아 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:04.311241Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:77/seg:0",
      "source": "is `mepc` set to the instruction that caused the exception or to the next instruction ?",
      "source_hash": 15058029220871225301,
      "context_hash": 13341684932053053031,
      "translation": "`mepc`는 예외를 유발한 명령어로 설정되는지, 아니면 다음 명령어로 설정되는지?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:04.311241Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:77/seg:1",
      "source": "Seeing what `MRET` does, it seems to be the next instruction, but we need to make sure: imagine we use compressed mode instructions implanted in an exception handler, then we would need to determine whether the instruction that caused the exception was `mepc-4` or `mepc-2`, painful ! (but I think it is the case)",
      "source_hash": 4786119302689817271,
      "context_hash": 7297046857376496334,
      "translation": "`MRET`이 하는 일을 보면 다음 명령어인 것으로 보이지만, 확실히 해야 합니다: 예외 핸들러 안에 압축 모드 명령어가 삽입되어 있다고 상상해 보면, 예외를 유발한 명령어가 `mepc-4`인지 `mepc-2`인지 판단해야 하는데, 이는 골치 아픈 일입니다! (하지만 그런 경우라고 생각합니다)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:04.311242Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:78/seg:0",
      "source": "what is the stuff to be done and undone with the machine status register ?",
      "source_hash": 14236077254129007900,
      "context_hash": 8219717010779301048,
      "translation": "머신 상태 레지스터에 대해 수행하고 되돌려야 하는 작업은 무엇인가?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:04.311242Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:78/seg:1",
      "source": "There are some bit manipulations with `SR_MIE` and `SR_MPIE` (probably for _machine interrupt enable_ and _machine pending interrupt enable_ or something).",
      "source_hash": 15087920616612759294,
      "context_hash": 14436392968756745222,
      "translation": "`SR_MIE`와 `SR_MPIE`를 사용한 몇 가지 비트 조작이 있습니다(아마도 *머신 인터럽트 활성화*와 *머신 보류 인터럽트 활성화* 같은 것을 의미할 것입니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:04.311243Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:78/seg:2",
      "source": "For now we can ignore them, since we mainly want to implement `ECALL`.",
      "source_hash": 5817521031630467469,
      "context_hash": 2319830326977818027,
      "translation": "지금은 이를 무시할 수 있는데, 우리는 주로 `ECALL`을 구현하고자 하기 때문입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:04.311244Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:78/seg:3",
      "source": "We will see interrupts after.",
      "source_hash": 2902504654632759068,
      "context_hash": 6453164353053854513,
      "translation": "인터럽트는 그 이후에 살펴보겠습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:04.311244Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:78/seg:4",
      "source": "Then there is something with `MPP`, what's that ?",
      "source_hash": 14656928743098003423,
      "context_hash": 9431108583600777247,
      "translation": "그다음 `MPP`와 관련된 것이 있는데, 이것은 무엇인가?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:04.311244Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:78/seg:5",
      "source": "It is defined in `rv32_isa.h` but there is no comment (the author supposes you are familiar with it already, which is not my case !), so let's dig in _volume II_: it is page 20, on `mstatus`: it is a stack used to keep track of the privilege level (and again, in our step 1 we can ignore this).",
      "source_hash": 6070987220615910186,
      "context_hash": 15524249107742370776,
      "translation": "`rv32_isa.h`에 정의되어 있지만 주석이 없어서(저자는 여러분이 이미 이것에 익숙하다고 가정한 것 같은데, 저는 그렇지 않습니다!), *2권*을 파헤쳐 보면: 20페이지, `mstatus` 항목에 있습니다: 이는 권한 수준을 추적하기 위해 사용되는 스택입니다(그리고 다시 말하지만, 우리의 1단계에서는 이를 무시할 수 있습니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:04.311244Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:79/seg:0",
      "source": "Two things:",
      "source_hash": 10771586211518497560,
      "context_hash": 10099671858305260856,
      "translation": "두 가지가 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:04.311244Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:80/seg:0",
      "source": "\"interrupt enable stack\" (depth 3, in fact 2), stored in machine status register.",
      "source_hash": 13498621542460822624,
      "context_hash": 12430020191410843115,
      "translation": "\"인터럽트 활성화 스택\"(깊이 3, 실제로는 2)이 머신 상태 레지스터에 저장됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:04.311245Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:80/seg:1",
      "source": "MIE : Machine Interrupt Enable MPIE: Machine Previous Interrupt Enable",
      "source_hash": 11650719710733079074,
      "context_hash": 15343875537252184597,
      "translation": "MIE : 머신 인터럽트 활성화 MPIE: 머신 이전 인터럽트 활성화",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:04.311245Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:81/seg:0",
      "source": "MPP (Machine Privilege P?) ?",
      "source_hash": 9007432491073245984,
      "context_hash": 14682440770270135744,
      "translation": "MPP(Machine Privilege P?)?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:04.311245Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
